.Dd August 14, 2026
.Dt FILEES-SSH-AUTH 8
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm filees-ssh-auth
.Nd BSD Authentication style for the FileES OTP tunnel
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
is installed as
.Pa /usr/libexec/auth/login_-filees
with owner
.Sy _filees-state ,
group
.Sy auth
and mode 4550.
.Xr sshd 8
invokes it for
.Sy _filees-tunnel
keyboard-interactive authentication.
.Pp
The OTP is received on file descriptor 3, not from the environment.
A successful comparison advances the operation bundle from
.Cm awaiting_tunnel
to
.Cm tunnel_authorized .
.Xr filees-entry 8
then claims that state.
.Pp
The
.Sy _filees-tunnel
password field must not be
.Ql * ;
BSD Auth rejects such accounts before a local style can run.
The OpenBSD installer writes an unknowable random hash.
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr filees-entry 8 ,
.Xr login.conf 5
